{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42972","headline":"鴈塔 · 解彦融","name":"鴈塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峥嵘澈倒景，刻峭俯无地。\n勇进攀有缘，即嶮恐迷坠。\n窅然丧五蕴，蠢尔怀万类。\n实际罔他寻，波罗必可致。\n南山缭上苑，只树连岩翠。\n北斗临帝城，扶宫切太清。\n餐和裨日用，味道懿天明。\n绿野冷风浃，紫微佳气晶。\n驯禽演法要，忍草藉经行。\n本愿从兹适，方知物世轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"解彦融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}